This implementation replaces the RTK engine directory in compress-core 0.5.0.
The implementation was written after examining the prior source and behavior.
Filter definitions, protocol behavior and configuration compatibility were
adapted from the following source; this is not a clean-room implementation:

  manjughosa/magpie-compress-core
  https://github.com/manjughosa/magpie-compress-core
  Reference commit: 630e2d512b1e2e5a063562f664dbf6e2accfb103
  Copyright (c) diegosouzapw, OmniRoute contributors
  Copyright (c) 2026 magpie-community contributors
  Copyright (c) 2026 Manjughosa
  MIT license text: LICENSES/compress-core-MIT.txt

The reference package records its RTK engine as a port through OmniRoute of:
  RTK: https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk
  Apache-2.0 license text: LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt
The reference package's root NOTICE, LICENSES and PROVENANCE.json are retained
by the installer. This directory does not replace those provenance records.

Changes include scanning consecutive runs without splitting all input lines,
bounded grouping samples, shared protocol traversal, compiling filter patterns
per invocation, and corrected handling of shell quoting and escaped separators.
Prior engine source files are removed from the installed RTK directory after
successful replacement; license and attribution records are preserved.
